  "description": "<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Rich Gone Broke watches draw their <strong>inspiration from the bohemian and creative lifestyle of Montmartre</strong> and the overall magic and elegance of Paris, the city of fashion and love.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The brand, since its <strong>creation in Paris in 2013</strong>,&nbsp;reflects the free and daring spirit that reigned in this district at the turn of the 19th and 20th centuries, inhabited by the Moulin Rouge, the Chat Noir and great&nbsp;artists such as Henri Toulouse-Lautrec, Pablo Picasso and Vincent van Gogh.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Like the spirit of those times, we believe every woman should express her creativity and individuality... </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>for free spirits who know what they want and have their own style</strong>.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>&ldquo;DARING CREATIVITY&rdquo;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Rich Gone Broke allows you to <strong>customize your accessory</strong> according to your outfit and mood thanks to a wide range of interchangeable straps.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The straps are designed with a <strong>focus on creativity, bold patterns and colorful palettes</strong>.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">To stay on top of fashion trends, Rich Gone Broke launches a new strap collection every season. Unlike traditional straps, Rich Gone Broke's <strong>bracelets are made of fabric and are tied</strong> (rather than buckled).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Give free rein to your creativity and personality!!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Payment terms: 1st week of the following month</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Other information:&nbsp; <strong>Over 80,000 watches sold</strong> worldwide.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Website: <a href=\"richgonebroke.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">richgonebroke.com</a></span></p>\r\n</div>",
